      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "drag_performer",
      "label": "Drag performer",
      "description": "A person who performs in drag, typically as part of LGBTQ+ culture, often involving exaggerated makeup, costumes, and gender expression. Drag performers are cultural icons of self-expression and queer identity, and their public performances are often a form of reclaiming space and visibility. The image of a drag performer is central to understanding the meme’s message about societal acceptance versus personal self-acceptance.",
